fix(chat): forward slash command props through ChatThread to empty-state composer

ChatEmptyState is rendered inside ChatThread, not directly by the page.
ChatThread now accepts usage/onSendMessage and forwards agents,
onAgentChange, currentAgentId, usage and onSendMessage down to the
empty-state composer so /agents /usage /compact /context work there too.

